{"title":"UK productivity update","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/973319531/0/marginalrevolution~UK-productivity-update.html","date":1795028036000,"content":"<blockquote><p><span>Output per hour worked increased by 2.5% in Quarter 3 (July to Sept) 2026 compared with the same quarter a year ago, reflecting a 2.0% increase in GVA and a 0.5% decrease in hours worked.</span></p>\r\n<p>Output per worker increased by 2.0% in Quarter 3 2026 compared with the same quarter a year ago. This was its strongest growth since Quarter 1 (Jan to Mar) 2018, excluding the pandemic period.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.ons.gov.uk/employmentandlabourmarket/peopleinwork/labourproductivity/articles/ukproductivityintroduction/julytoseptember2026#latest-productivity-estimates-for-quarter--\" target=\"_blank\">the official release</a>, via Peter Whittaker.  First, they are going to squeak through.  Second, immigration did not ruin the country and will not lead to civil war.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/11/uk-productivity-update.html\">UK productivity update</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/973319531/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/973319531/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/973319531/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/973319531/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/